   "segment": "EU politics + cross-cutting",
   "country": "EU / Ukraine / United Kingdom",
   "text": "Leaders at the [[e:9th European Political Community Summit]] {{note: Forum of some 47 European leaders, first convened in Prague in October 2022 on Emmanuel Macron's initiative.}} in Dublin and the informal EU summit after it agreed Europe's team for the next Ukraine round will mix EU officials with the E5 (France, Germany, UK, Italy, Poland). No single envoy was named; [[p:Kaja Kallas]] says it should be her. The Kremlin is noncommittal.",
